# Class I

No PDB available for Class I, So we take the AlphaFold model of the Class I structure:

```
open https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-P0AC33-F1-model_v6.pdb
```

Some setup:
```
set bgColor white
lighting simple
```

Selecting the active sites:

```
select #1:105,224,318
```

### Coloring
| chain | active sites |
| ------|--------------|
| #afa08b | #ab752a |

```
color #1 #afa08b
color sel #ab752a
```

### Active sites

Show the atoms of the active sites and present them as spheres:

```
show sel
style sel spheres
```

Adding labels to the active sites:

```
label sel text "{0.name}{0.number}" color black height 2
```

Make 185-193 transparent to get a better view of the active sites:

```
transparency #1:185-193 80 all
```

Removing the selection:
```
~sel
```


# Class II

We take the AlphaFold model (to match Class I, and highlight correct active sites) of the Class II structure. Before that, we take the 1YFE PDB structure so superimpose the AlphaFold monomer 4 times on it:

```
open 1YFE
sym #1 assembly 1 newModel true
```

Some setup:
```
set bgColor white
lighting simple
```

The AlphaFold model:

```
open https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-P05042-F1-model_v6.pdb
```

Getting the full tetrameric structure:

```
mmaker #3 to #2.1
combine #3 name AF_B; mmaker #4 to #2.2
combine #3 name AF_C; mmaker #5 to #2.3
combine #3 name AF_D; mmaker #6 to #2.4
```

Hide the templates:
```
hide #1,2 models
```

### Coloring

| chain | active sites |
|-------|--------------|
| #c8a5b6 | #cc56ca |
| #b68a8a | #bf3f3f |
| #7c926d | #4a911b |
| #567275 | #207079 |

```
color #3 #c8a5b6
color #3:188,318,324,331 #cc56ca

color #4 #b68a8a
color #4:188,318,324,331 #bf3f3f

color #5 #7c926d
color #5:188,318,324,331 #4a911b

color #6 #567275
color #6:188,318,324,331 #207079
```

Hide 2 of the chains to get a better view of the active sites:

```
transparency #6 80 all
transparency #3 80 all
```

Or use `hide` command to hide the chains.

### Active sites
Show the atoms of the active sites and present them as spheres:

```
show #3-6:188,318,324,331
style #3-6:188,318,324,331 sphere
```

Adding labels to the active sites:

```
label #3-6:188,318,324,331 text "{0.name}{0.number}" color black height 2
```